### Test Commute Map API

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get user profile (replace TOKEN with actual token from login response)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Create a commute route (replace TOKEN with actual token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/commute
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "上班路線",
  "description": "從家到公司的路線",
  "startAddress": "台北車站",
  "endAddress": "信義區",
  "transportMode": "driving"
}

### Get all commute routes (replace TOKEN with actual token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/commute
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Search places (replace TOKEN with actual token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/commute/search/places?query=台北101&lat=25.0330&lng=121.5654
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Get directions (replace TOKEN with actual token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/commute/directions?origin=台北車站&destination=信義區&mode=driving
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
